**1.** Faites un [tableau 1](../glossary.qmd#table-1){.term} qui compare le **site A au site B** au lieu de la PTH à la PTG. Quelle [variable](../glossary.qmd#variable){.term} diffère le plus entre les sites, selon la [SMD](../glossary.qmd#smd){.term} ?

::: {.callout-tip collapse="true"}
## Solution

::: {.panel-tabset group="language"}
## R


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
cohort |>
  select(site, all_of(table1_vars)) |>
  tbl_summary(by = site, type = list(los_days ~ "continuous"),
              statistic = list(all_continuous() ~ "{mean} ({sd})",
                               los_days ~ "{median} ({p25}–{p75})"),
              digits = list(all_continuous() ~ 1, los_days ~ 0),
              label = labels) |>
  add_difference(test = everything() ~ "smd")
```

